OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 7 Sep to Wed 16 Sep
OL,6,FOverall, a fairly unsettled period is
OL,7,Flikely, with many places seeing
OL,8,Fshowers or longer spells of rain at
OL,9,Ftimes, interspersed by drier periods.
OL,10,FRain will likely be most frequent
OL,11,Facross northern and western areas,
OL,12,Fwhile the south and east are more
OL,13,Flikely to see longer drier interludes.
OL,14,FThere is also the potential for some
OL,15,Fstrong and gusty winds, particularly
OL,16,Fin the northwest. Temperatures are
OL,17,Flikely to be near average, although
OL,18,Fbrief warm or very warm spells are
OL,19,Fpossible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
